      "q": "How much does Department of Education spend on contracts?",
      "a": "The Department of Education obligated $2.2B on contracts in FY2026 to date. The Department recorded 703 awards with an average award size of $3.1M. The Department's obligations were down 11.8% year over year and the FY2026 totals are partial because the period is fiscal year to date."
